	"talks": [
		{
			"id": 1203101,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1203101
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1203101",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1203101,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Yae Miko",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120310101,
					"content": "Well hello there, my little helpers, so nice of you to join me. You're right on time, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310102,
					"content": "Hmph, as if we had a choice. We just want our paychecks.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310103,
					"content": "So, Miko, what exactly do we have to do to make this Hyakkiyakou happen?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310104,
					"content": "Also, to be clear, we actually have no idea what it even means.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310105,
					"content": "It might sound ominous, but to put it simply, the Hyakkiyakou is just a gathering of the youkai.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310106,
					"content": "Back in the day, at youkai gatherings, once everyone had had plenty to drink, one by one they'd start soaring into the sky with their youkai powers. There were so many of them that their silhouettes would block out the moon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310107,
					"content": "But now, the youkai memories that leak from the Ley Lines are weak. They are no longer able to fly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310108,
					"content": "So, I will be performing a convocation ritual for them, gathering all the wandering memories together in one place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310109,
					"content": "When the time comes, they will gather in the sky above the Grand Narukami Shrine. Once their energy is spent, they will be satisfied, and return to where they belong.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310110,
					"content": "I see. I understand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120310111,
					"content": "All the preparations for the ritual have actually been made well in advance. Remember the incantation and the mention of \"moonless night\" that I added to our novel?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310112,
					"content": "Oh yeah, something about reciting \"The Secret Spells of Lady Kitsune\" on a moonless night.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310113,
					"content": "That's the one. Actually, it's not a wish-granting incantation at all. It's a spell to help calm the Ley Line memories.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310114,
					"content": "When that time comes, let's all pitch in and help send them on their way!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310115,
					"content": "What do you need from me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120310116,
					"content": "I will start the ritual preparations shortly, and at that time, I need you to do two things:",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310117,
					"content": "First, tell the shrine maidens to leave the mountain.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310118,
					"content": "During the Hyakkiyakou, a whole swarm of youkai memories will be hanging around in the air above the Grand Narukami Shrine. Having the shrine maidens leave avoids the bothersome issue of someone potentially getting possessed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310119,
					"content": "After that, I will commence the ritual, and the memories will begin to congregate. This will take some time. I need you at the foot of Mt. Yougou during this part to keep an eye on nearby monster activity.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310120,
					"content": "The memories are normally dispersed, and don't pose a threat. But when their energy is concentrated, it is likely to disturb the monsters.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310121,
					"content": "They may see this as an opportunity to try and make it up the mountain. I need you to fend them off so that that doesn't happen.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310122,
					"content": "Alright, got it. Then what?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310123,
					"content": "Hmm... Well, if at that point you felt like coming to the shrine and getting a close-up view of the youkai, I wouldn't say no.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120310124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yae Miko"
				},
				{
					"id": 120310124,
					"content": "#Okay, {NICKNAME}, let's get going!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1203102,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1203102
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
