					"nextDialogs": [
						120311904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tetsuo"
				},
				{
					"id": 120311904,
					"content": "But then nothing happened after I made a wish using the method in that book.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120311905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oosuke"
				},
				{
					"id": 120311905,
					"content": "*sigh* I guess light novels are just fiction after all, huh.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120311906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tetsuo"
				},
				{
					"id": 120311906,
					"content": "That night was definitely the nail in the coffin for the \"incantations from novels\" fad. Still, something tells me \"The Miraculous Adventures of the Traveler\" will remain an interesting series for a long time to come!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120311907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oosuke"
				},
				{
